格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Session hotkeys for DeepSeek Harness Web · 给 DeepSeek Harness Web 的会话快捷键插件","id":"gh:1335357809","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-session-hotkeys","slug":"YEYEYEYESHIFU/dsh-session-hotkeys","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","hotkeys"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Session hotkeys for DeepSeek Harness Web · 给 DeepSeek Harness Web 的会话快捷键插件"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-hotkeys"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Session hotkeys for DeepSeek Harness Web · 给 DeepSeek Harness Web 的会话快捷键插件"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Switch sessions from the keyboard the way you switch browser tabs.\n像切换浏览器标签页一样用键盘管理会话。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Then restart DSH Web. 然后重启 DSH Web 即可。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Why"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Alt+1-9 jumps straight to the Nth session**, `Alt+↑/↓` cycles through them — no mouse needed.\n- "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"**Everything is rebindable** from the panel, with Windows / macOS presets that are screened against "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"browser & system shortcuts.\n- **Works while you're typing** in the chat input — no blur-first step. "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"Plain typing never triggers anything.\n- **Esc toggles to the chat**: the first press hands focus to "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"the transcript (↑↓ / PgUp / PgDn scroll), closing the panel, exiting nav, or dismissing the model me"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"nu on the way; the second press returns focus to exactly where it was — model selector (ring restore"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"d), input (caret intact), anything. Composer popups (slash commands) and IME keep their own Esc.\n- *"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"*Pure browser plugin**: no network requests, no server-side state, nothing collected."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Keybindings"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Defaults shown; rebind any of them in the panel (`Alt+P` → Keys tab)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Action | Windows | macOS |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Switch to Nth session | `Alt+1-9` | `⌃⇧1-9` |\n| Previous / next session | `Alt+↑` / `Alt+↓` | `⌃⌥↑"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"` / `⌃⌥↓` |\n| Pin slot (pin / jump / unpin) | `Alt+Shift+1-9` | `⌃⌥1-9` |\n| Jump to pinned slot | `C"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"trl+Alt+1-9` | `⌃⌥⇧1-9` |\n| New session | `Alt+N` | `⌃⌥N` |\n| Archive current session | `Alt+Shift+A"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"` | `⌃⌥A` |\n| Open archived list | `Alt+Shift+U` | `⌃⌥U` |\n| Rename current session | `Alt+Shift+R` "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"| `⌃⌥R` |\n| Navigation mode (`↑↓` select · `Enter` open · `Esc` cancel) | `` Alt+` `` | `` ⌃` `` |\n|"},{"id":"p15s6","text":" Open panel | `Alt+P` | `⌃⌥P` |\n| Collapse / expand the conversation sidebar | `Alt+B` | `⌃⌥B` |\n| C"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"lose the focused split pane (last one tucks the workspace away) | `Alt+W` | `⌃⌥W` |\n| Focus search b"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"ox | `Alt+Shift+F` | `⌃⇧F` |\n| Focus model selector | `Alt+M` | `⌃⌥M` |\n| Focus back to chat input |"},{"id":"p15s9","text":" `Alt+Enter` | `⌃⌥Enter` |\n| Toggle chat focus (Esc → transcript, again → back; panel/nav/menu cance"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"l on the way) | `Esc` | `Esc` |\n| Send with alternate busy behavior | `Alt+Shift+Enter` | `⌃⌥⇧Enter`"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"on the way) | `Esc` | `Esc` |\n| Send with alternate busy behavior | `Alt+Shift+Enter` | `⌃⌥⇧Enter` |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Notes"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **Archiving** asks for confirmation first and never deletes anything — archived sessions stay list"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ed in the panel's Archived page. (DSH 0.1.x has no public unarchive API, so restoring is host-side.)"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"\n- Bindings and pins are saved in browser localStorage and survive restarts. Clearing site data rese"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ts them.\n- The sidebar must be expanded: session order is read from the rendered rows."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Why the macOS preset looks like this"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Chrome maps both `⌘+1-9` and `⌃+1-9` to tab switching (Safari: `⌘+1-9`), so positional switching use"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"s `⌃⇧1-9`. `⌥` alone would type special characters, so it is never used by itself. `⌃+↑/↓` is Missio"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"n Control and `⌃+N/P/F/B/A/E/K/D` are Emacs line-editing keys in text fields, hence the `⌥` addition"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"s elsewhere. `⌃/⌘+Enter` are the composer's own send chords, so the Enter-family adds `⌥`. All combo"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"s were screened against macOS Chrome and Safari. On macOS all bindings render with native symbols (⌃"},{"id":"p19s6","text":" ⌥ ⇧ ⌘). The only modifier-free binding is `Esc` — no browser conflict in Chrome or Safari, the IME-"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"cancel Esc is left untouched, and ⌘/⌃+Esc variants never match."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Compatibility & known limitations"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- Tested with DSH Web from `@deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.1-rc.2`; re-verified end-to-end on `@deepseek-ai/ds"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"h@0.1.5-rc.2` (2026-09-15) in both the standard and the split-view UI.\n- Session order / search-box "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"/ model-selector targeting depend on DSH Web DOM class names (fuzzy fallbacks included); an upgrade "},{"id":"p21s4","text":"may require updating this plugin.\n- On Windows, Alt-key default behavior is suppressed inside DSH We"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"b so Chrome doesn't swallow `Alt+digits`; the tradeoff is numpad Alt-code entry (e.g. `Alt+0167`) do"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"esn't work in input fields.\n- Key recording accepts letters, `` ` `` (backtick), F1–F12, and digits "},{"id":"p21s7","text":"1–9 (top row or numpad; NumLock required for numpad). Pressing `Esc` cancels recording, so the defau"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"lt `Esc` binding (input → chat) is restored with Reset rather than re-recorded."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Older CLI without dsh plugin"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"1. Add `dsh-session-hotkeys` to both `dependencies` and `dsh.profile.bundles` in the profile's `pack"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"age.json`\n2. Run `pnpm install` inside the profile directory\n3. Restart DSH"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 简体中文"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### 为什么值得装"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **Alt+1-9 直达第 N 个会话**，Alt+↑/↓ 循环切换——全程不用鼠标。\n- **所有键位都能改**，面板里录制式改键；Windows / macOS 双预设已逐项筛查系统与浏览器冲"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"突。\n- **输入框聚焦时也能用**，切会话不用先退出打字状态；普通打字永远不会误触发。\n- **Esc 切换到聊天区**：第一按把焦点交给会话内容（↑↓ / PgUp / PgDn 滚动），途中顺带"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"关闭面板、退出导航、收起模型菜单；再按一次精确还原原焦点——模型选择（含高亮环）、输入框（光标原位）等。斜杠命令弹层与 IME 的 Esc 不受影响。\n- **纯浏览器插件**：无网络请求、无服务端状"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"收起模型菜单；再按一次精确还原原焦点——模型选择（含高亮环）、输入框（光标原位）等。斜杠命令弹层与 IME 的 Esc 不受影响。\n- **纯浏览器插件**：无网络请求、无服务端状态、不收集任何数据。"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### 键位表"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"以下为默认键位，均可在面板（Alt+P → 按键页）重新录制。"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| 动作 | Windows | macOS |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| 切换到第 N 个会话 | `Alt+1-9` | `⌃⇧1-9` |\n| 上一个 / 下一个会话 | `Alt+↑` / `Alt+↓` | `⌃⌥↑` / `⌃⌥↓` |\n| 固定槽位三态（固定"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"/跳转/取消） | `Alt+Shift+1-9` | `⌃⌥1-9` |\n| 跳转固定槽位 | `Ctrl+Alt+1-9` | `⌃⌥⇧1-9` |\n| 新建会话 | `Alt+N` | `⌃⌥N"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"` |\n| 归档当前会话 | `Alt+Shift+A` | `⌃⌥A` |\n| 打开已归档列表 | `Alt+Shift+U` | `⌃⌥U` |\n| 重命名当前会话 | `Alt+Shift+R`"},{"id":"p31s4","text":" | `⌃⌥R` |\n| 导航模式（↑↓ 选择 · Enter 进入 · Esc 取消） | `` Alt+` `` | `` ⌃` `` |\n| 打开面板 | `Alt+P` | `⌃⌥P` |\n|"},{"id":"p31s5","text":" 折叠 / 展开左侧会话栏 | `Alt+B` | `⌃⌥B` |\n| 关闭聚焦的分屏面板（最后一个收起工作区） | `Alt+W` | `⌃⌥W` |\n| 聚焦并清空搜索框 | `Alt+Shift"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"+F` | `⌃⇧F` |\n| 聚焦模型选择 | `Alt+M` | `⌃⌥M` |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
